flowchart LR
  subgraph Join
    A[Viewer sends !join] --> B[Bot posts the public link]
    B --> C[Lobby shows a code for this tab]
    C --> D[Viewer types !join CODE in Twitch or Kick chat]
    D --> E[Tab seated as twitch:id or kick:id with its role]
    C -.-> G[Or: play as unverified web guest]
  end
  subgraph Play
    E --> P[Game runs sandboxed on the controller]
    G --> P
    P --> F[Browser receives drawing primitives only]
    P -->|game fails| W[Watchdog switches to a reviewed fallback]
  end
  subgraph Build
    I[Chat proposes !idea and votes] --> S[Streamer approves the exact input]
    S --> V1[Codex builds in VM1]
    V1 --> V2[VM2 tests it]
    V2 --> R[Streamer approves the exact artifact]
    R -.->|phase 4| V3[VM3 runs it live]
  end
